# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Line endings
#
# Shell scripts MUST stay LF. GitHub Actions, Render and any Linux container run
# them with /bin/sh, and a CRLF shebang ("#!/bin/sh\r") makes the interpreter
# fail to start, so the container dies immediately with an error that points
# nowhere near the real cause.
#
# core.autocrlf on a Windows checkout would otherwise be free to rewrite a .sh
# file, so it is pinned here rather than left to a local git setting.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf

# Windows-native files keep CRLF.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Binary: never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
